              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, ee Mwenyezi Mlungu, ritimize rira neno uchirorigomba kuhusu mimi mtumishio na kuhusu chivyazi changu hata kare na kare. Henda kama uchivyogomba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
