          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "henda hivyo ili dzinaro rimanyikane kare na kare. Atu andaamba, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi ndiye Mlungu wa Iziraeli. Nacho chivyazi cha mtumishio Daudi, chindaimarishwa mberezo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
